ASSEMBLY NOTE, August 26, 2026
==============================
The final green run of stress_mortality.py (34 cases, 24 PASS, 10 FLAG)
completed in the Cowork sandbox at /tmp/mort_st/, but the sandbox shell then
failed with the known bridge-socket fault (Failure C in the workspace notes)
before the log file could be copied off, and the sandbox is ephemeral. This
file therefore splices the VERBATIM captured segments from the session
transcript rather than pretending to be a byte-exact copy. The harness is
bitwise deterministic (section g), so rerunning

    python3 stress_mortality.py

with sys.path pointed at figshare_v64/ regenerates the exact final log.

